    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just doesn't feel like i'm trying my best. it feels like i'm just making things harder for them. every time things get tough, it's because of me. honestly, i look at them and i just think how much better their life would be if they didn't have to worry about me or deal with my constant stress and failures. they'd be free of it all.",
